<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Donation Process</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Manrope', sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f7f7f7;
}

/* Heading */
.divider{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;   /* Space between the two lines */
    margin:15px 0;
}

.line{
    width:70px;
    height:2px;
    background:#c62828;
}
.donation-header{
    text-align:center;
    padding:50px 20px 30px;
}

.donation-header h2{
    font-size:42px;
    color:#c62828;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}

.divider{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    margin:15px 0;
}

.line{
    width:70px;
    height:2px;
    background:#c62828;
}


.donation-header p{
    color:#666;
    font-size:18px;
}

/* Section */

.donation-process{
    padding:8px 0 40px;
}

.container{
    width:90%;
    max-width:1250px;
    margin:auto;
}

.steps{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
    gap:30px;
}

/* Card */

.step{
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:12px;
    border-top:4px solid #e74c3c;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    transition:.3s;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
}

.step:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}

.step-image{
    position:relative;
}

.step-image img{
    width:100%;
    height:220px;
    object-fit:cover;
}

.step-number{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:12px;
    right:12px;
    width:42px;
    height:42px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#c62828;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:bold;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
}

.step h3{
    color:#c62828;
    text-align:center;
    margin:20px 0 15px;
    font-size:32px;
}

.step ul{
    padding:0 25px 15px;
    margin:0;
}

.step ul li{
    color:#444;
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.4;   /* Reduced from 1.8 */
    margin-bottom:6px; /* Reduced from 12px */
    text-align:left;
}

.step ul li:last-child{
    margin-bottom:0;
}

.step ul li::marker{
    color:#c62828;
    font-size:18px;
}

/* Mobile */

@media(max-width:768px){

.step h3{
    font-size:28px;
}

.donation-header h2{
    font-size:34px;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="donation-header">

<h2>DONATION PROCESS</h2>

<div class="divider">
<span class="line"></span>
<span> 🩸</span>
<span class="line"></span>
</div>

<p>The donation process from the time you arrive at the center until the time you leave.</p>

</div>

<section class="donation-process">

<div class="container">

<div class="steps">

<!-- Card 1 -->

<div class="step">

<div class="step-image">
<img src="/images/process_1.jpg" alt="Registration">
<span class="step-number">1</span>
</div>

<h3>Registration</h3>

<ul>
<li>Complete the donor registration form.</li>
<li>Provide your contact information.</li>
<li>Share basic medical history.</li>
<li>Receive your donor record.</li>
</ul>

</div>

<!-- Card 2 -->

<div class="step">

<div class="step-image">
<img src="/images/process_2.jpg" alt="Screening">
<span class="step-number">2</span>
</div>

<h3>Screening</h3>

<ul>
<li>Finger-prick blood sample.</li>
<li>Check hemoglobin level.</li>
<li>Measure blood pressure.</li>
<li>Confirm donation eligibility.</li>
</ul>

</div>

<!-- Card 3 -->

<div class="step">

<div class="step-image">
<img src="/images/process_3.jpg" alt="Donation">
<span class="step-number">3</span>
</div>

<h3>Donation</h3>

<ul>
<li>Relax on the donor chair.</li>
<li>Donation takes only 6–10 minutes.</li>
<li>Performed by trained professionals.</li>
<li>Safe, clean and comfortable process.</li>
</ul>

</div>

<!-- Card 4 -->

<div class="step">

<div class="step-image">
<img src="/images/process_4.jpg" alt="Refreshment">
<span class="step-number">4</span>
</div>

<h3>Refreshment</h3>

<ul>
<li>Rest for 10–15 minutes.</li>
<li>Enjoy juice and light snacks.</li>
<li>Regain your energy.</li>
<li>Leave when you feel comfortable.</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

</body>
</html>